# VocaNova harness

Follow `AGENTS.md` as the repository-wide engineering guide. Reusable workflows live in `.agents/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`; start with `.agents/skills/using-agent-skills/SKILL.md` when routing is unclear.

Use the smallest applicable skill, preserve unrelated changes, run repository-owned validation, and do not deploy or mutate remote systems without explicit authority for that action.
